WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.440
*Ravel's Bolero playing in the background*

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:04.200
Gigguk: Dear God of Anime,

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:06.600
I know it's been a while since we last talked,

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:07.800
but how you doin'?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.400
I've been doing pretty good,

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.400
and I can see that you've been pretty busy yourself

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.520
with all the new anime you've been pumping out.

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:17.360
This season's been... alright so far,

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:20.800
I mean, Mob Psycho 100 is pretty good and 91 Days is decent,

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:24.060
but, hey! Great going on that Re:Zero, man!

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:27.080
Everyone is eating that shit up like crack.

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:31.280
But, uh... Do we really need another Sword Art Online movie-

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:35.200
Nope, you know what? I trust that you know what you're doing, so let's not go there.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:37.480
Anyway, I don't want to take up too much of your time

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:40.880
as I know you're a busy guy and all, so... All I really wanted to ask

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:43.200
is that you make another season of One-Punch Man.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:47.140
The first season was pretty dope, and you know it was pretty popular too

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:50.440
so, I'm sure the whole world wouldn't mind seeing a bit more of it.

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:51.220
Cool?

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:53.880
Alright, that was pretty much all of it, THANKS BYE!!!

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:59.220
Though... if you DID have a bit more time on your hands,

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:01.700
there were a few more things I wanted to see.

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:03.460
If we're still talking sequels,

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:06.840
I don't know how many more years you're gonna make me wait for another season

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:11.600
of Baccano! I mean, you gave one to Durarara!! So don't tell me it's not possible, alright?

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:18.400
*sobbing*
It's not like I've spent the last 9 years praying for you to make this happen or anything...

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:20.640
*quiet sobbing*

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:24.560
Also, while you're at it, how 'bout another season of Spice &amp; Wolf?

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:28.440
Look, you gave us a legitimately interesting show about economics

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:31.820
then took that away from us, so now what the hell are we supposed to watch?

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:35.200
Do you even know how boring economics really is

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:37.560
when there's not a naked wolf-lady that comes with it?

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:39.500
It's REALLY fucking boring, alright?

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:42.360
I mean, compared to that, the finance channel is just like...

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:46.460
Well, it just looks like a bunch of pompous twats arguing about numbers, really.

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:50.180
And don't even get me started on how you left the Haruhi franchise.

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:53.960
Look, I don't care how many dudes Aya Hirano has banged,

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:58.000
and I'm sure nobody else does still care except for possibly the bass guitarist,

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:01.300
but you can't make one of the greatest franchise films of all time

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.640
and then just leave it there!

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:06.520
Look, I'd even take people doing the fucking Hare Hare Yukai dance in public again

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:07.860
if I can see more Haruhi, alright?

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:09.860
What happens to Kyon when he opens the door?

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:11.560
Are they actually having hotpot?

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:14.000
Is Haruhi being an arrogant, bossy bitch again?

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.440
Is the world on fire?

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:17.720
Is there a massive orgy going on?

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:18.900
I need to know!!!

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:20.560
And I know there's more sequels I need,

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:22.540
but on this topic, Madhouse...

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:24.360
Yes, I'm talking to YOU,

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:27.220
Studio "I Fucking hate Making Sequels" MADHOUSE,

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:29.120
how about you stop making half-decent shows

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:31.280
and just ending it at a single season, yeah?

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:33.380
You may think people will forget the amount of times

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:35.660
you've dangled plot points for another season in front of us

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:37.180
in shows like Highschool of the Dead,

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:38.360
No Game No Life,

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:39.220
Overlord,

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:39.820
Btooom!,

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:40.560
and One-Punch Man,

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:41.280
but we don't.

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:44.920
It's ingrained in our minds eternally, and we're still waiting!

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:46.480
Look, I get it.

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:49.920
Working on Redline for 7 goddamn years has given you some commitment issues,

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:52.920
but it's been, what, 7 years since that was released, now?

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:55.320
It's time to get back in the game, man.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:59.500
Settle on a show or two to stick with till the end, and you might even make a fair buck from it!

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:02.600
Look what SHAFT have done with Monogatari and A1 have done with-

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:03.840
...

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:05.160
...okay, bad example.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:07.440
Just don't take sequel advice from Bones, okay?

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:08.680
That's all I really ask.

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:11.380
Bones, I love you, but Darker than Black Season 2

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:14.140
and Eureka Seven: AO have just kind of scarred me for life.

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:17.420
And also, don't listen to Gainax about endings either.

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:19.260
*cough* Fucking Panty &amp; Stocking!

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:22.140
Actually, Madhouse, you know what? Screw the sequel thing.

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:26.940
All you really need to do to make me happy is the complete anime adaptation of 20th Century Boys

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:27.880
like you did with Monster.

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:30.800
Now I've been fighting all the naysayers who've been telling me

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:33.880
that you'll never do it in this day and age, but I have faith.

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:36.840
Maybe you'd be more interested in it if Guillermo del Toro

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:39.060
actually got the live-action Monster approved?

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:40.100
Maybe?

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:43.960
And maybe you'd give me the shonen adaptation of PSYREN like I always wanted?

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:47.960
C'mon, you know it'd be better than 90% of the other Shonens coming out right now.

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:50.960
I mean, you gave Akame Ga Fucking Kill a bloody shot,

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.680
so it can't be that unlikely, right?

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:56.060
But if I can't have that, how 'bout just a Shonen with a tournament?

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:59.740
No, I don't mean like the battle royale free-for-alls we see everywhere nowadays

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:01.120
or that one in One Piss,

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:03.160
Just a pure, one-on-one battle,

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:07.140
Mano y Mano like we used to see literally everywhere in the old days.

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:09.060
Not that I don't love Shokugeki,

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:12.440
but there is a difference between seeing fists flying at each other

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:16.120
and watching people having multiple orgasms at the sight of some cheese on toast, you know?

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:20.420
Also, Mr. God of Anime, can you PLEASE say something to the Devil of Anime

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:24.520
because I am tired of him pissing all over the Berserk franchise.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:27.960
Now I don't know who sold their soul to the devil to get more Berserk made,

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:29.800
but now we know that the fucking catch was

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:33.160
it would make any Berserk fan want to burn their eyeballs out with hot iron.

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:35.580
Now I'm not sure if you cursed this franchise or something,

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:38.840
but it would be nice if it finally got the adaptation it deserved.

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:42.780
Y'know, a full length series that is not a Powerpoint presentation slideshow,

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:46.100
but at the same time not an amateur CG animation that would make anyone

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:48.580
who watches it want to castrate themselves with a pair of pliers.

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.440
Also, tell Miura I said hi!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:54.400
Uh, tell him it's no rush, but I do hope I can see

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:57.400
the end of Berserk in my lifetime, no pressure.

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.720
Also, while you're there, tell Oda I'm looking forward

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:01.340
to seeing the end of One Piece in my next life.

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:03.480
On a lighter note, though, I see that you've watched my

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:07.400
5 Concepts I'd Like to See in Anime video since you're actually making an esports anime!

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:08.600
Thanks for that!

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:12.840
I genuinely didn't know about it until half the viewers of that video told me about it.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:13.700
Wait...

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:15.240
what'd you mean this isn't an anime?

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:16.180
What?

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:18.060
This is being made in China, you say?

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:19.520
Sooooo...

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:22.480
that means it's techinically

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:23.420
a

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:24.440
Chinese

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:26.080
Cartoon...

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:27.640
HOOOOO!

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:30.660
Okay, well this is awkward...

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:33.320
........

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:37.920
Moving on, will I one day be able to hear Steve Blum's sexy voice in another anime?

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:40.080
Heck, I'd even take Crispin Freeman again.

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:43.460
I know that we're trying to broaden our voice acting pool above these two,

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:46.540
Wendee Lee, Johnny Yong Bosch, and Luci Christian we had 10 years ago,

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:50.180
but I've yet to encounter another voice that could caress my eardrums

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:53.620
in such sensual pleasures their voices did back in the day.

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:54.360
*inhales*

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:55.180
No Homo...

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:55.920
...

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:56.760
Oh, who am I kidding,

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:57.560
COMPLETE

00:05:57.560 --> 00:05:58.100
FUCKING

00:05:58.100 --> 00:05:58.760
HOMO

00:05:58.760 --> 00:06:02.660
And how about, a horror anime that is actually scary?

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:05.020
Don't get cocky 'cause a bunch of people thought

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:06.740
"My Loli's Can't Be This Crazy"

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:09.120
and "Yet Another Gore Fest" was scary,

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:13.760
I'm talking about a proper, suspenseful show that is entirely dedicated to horror.

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:16.140
Not this, "Hey, I'm gonna label this as horror

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:18.580
but is really a Shonen action show with lots of blood."

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:21.700
We all know your people can do live-action horror masterfully,

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:24.900
so why is it so difficult to translate this into an anime show?

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:27.640
Monster and Perfect Blue are the closest you've definitely come,

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:31.280
but I'm sure you can come up with an amazing horror that isn't just psychological.

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:33.100
Speaking of things that need to be made,

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:36.460
hat's off to you for finally getting Kizumono out and everything,

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:40.420
but is Evangelion 4.0 gonna follow in its footsteps anytime soon?

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:43.800
I mean, have you given Hideaki Anno crippling depression again?

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:48.300
Or is the wait for 4.0 the actual ending to the Rebuild of Evangelion?

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:52.100
Which would only be slightly more satisfying than the actual End of Evangelion.

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:55.080
But aside from all this, do you know what I miss?

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:58.480
Original stories and complete endings.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.920
Not that I have a problem with light novel adaptations,

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:04.120
but there is just a tiny bit too much going on now, isn't there?

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:06.520
Maybe you could throw us some original IP (Intellectual Property) our way

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:09.980
once in a while so we know that we're gonna get a complete story from the start?

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:14.220
But I know studios don't like taking risks on new things, so how about this?

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:18.680
How about we just get adaptations of source material that is already complete?

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:19.600
*mind blow SFX*

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.960
I know, right? That's pretty mind blowing.

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:24.600
There've been way too many 12 episode anime recently

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:27.740
that only exist as a glorified advertisement to their source material.

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:28.980
What happened to the good old days,

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:31.500
when having at least a 24 episode series was the norm

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:33.500
and everything above that was the exception?

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:36.660
Endings that would tie up everything it needed in a nice, little package

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:40.340
instead of the usual legions of fans asking how much source material there is available,

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:42.540
or an ending consisting of an anime studio going,

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:44.980
"Uhh... Is, is this gonna make money?

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:47.760
I mean, we'll make another season of it if it makes money...

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:48.540
Maybe?

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:49.360
Probably not."

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:50.380
No more of that, okay?

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:51.380
And ERASED

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:52.120
DOESN'T

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:52.680
Fucking

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:53.300
Count!

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.300
Anyway, that about sums everything up.

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:58.760
I know you're a busy geezer, but I do hope to see some of these things one day.

00:07:59.060 --> 00:07:59.840
Love and Kisses,

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.720
TsundereFuckBoi95

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:02.920
A.K.A.

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:03.980
Gigguk

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.960
Oh, and P.S. I'm still waiting for you to make Waifus real, yeah?

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:13.940
Gigguk: Hey, guys! Hope you enjoyed the video!

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:15.600
Thank you very much this month to:

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:16.400
Gabe Brown,

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:17.360
Thomas B,

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:18.360
Vincent Mooney,

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:19.220
Merederai,

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:21.820
and everyone else supporting me on Patreon for making this possible.

00:08:21.820 --> 00:08:24.580
Now, if you think I missed something that you'd want to see from anime,

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:26.700
please leave a comment telling me or do your own open letter

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:29.520
since I'm sure I forgot something that we all want, right?

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:31.700
Anyway, that's it from me, no updates from me this time,

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:34.360
I've been Gigguk, and I'll see you all next time!

